HandType 1.2.0
• Your own cursive handwriting now joins the letters of a word with your own strokes, also at the top after o, v and w (Premium).
• Missing punctuation and accents are drawn in your own pen style (Premium).
• The handwriting sheet has four guide lines per cell, so small letters stay small. Older sheets still scan.
• Better results from filled-in sheets: longer descenders, tall capitals, i dots and wide letters like x and w.
• Smaller download: the app is about half the size.
